# biosequence / Ran Moshe Vaknin

## Extensions:

* pseudo-alignment with quality filtering (EXTQUALITY) - filtering the reads or kmers by their quality or by their count of mapping genomes.

* EXTSIM- filtering the genomes by their similarity level to other genomes

## Design

I chose to store any group of object in a dictionary, list or set depend on it's usage. 
most of the time i prefered dictionaries because of their efficiency and the complexity 
of finding a specific object O(1). 
I chose to use the HIGHEST-PROTOCOL tool when i created a pickle file and to compress it 
with gzip to minimize the files sizes. 
I chose to use object-oriented programming to store different data for each type of data
that I have. 
I used libraries like numpy or re to minimize the time of applying some functions. 
I chose to stop the program as soon as possible if there is an invalid input and to filter
the data from every file as soon as possible to minimize the running time of the program.
